OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1788448707
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 18 Sep to Fri 2 Oct
OL,6,FSettled conditions are most likely
OL,7,Finitially before a transition to more
OL,8,Funsettled and changeable conditions
OL,9,Ftowards the latter parts of September,
OL,10,Fthough confidence is low at this lead
OL,11,Ftime. Driest conditions through this
OL,12,Fperiod are likely to be seen across
OL,13,Fthe south east, with wetter and
OL,14,Fwindier weather more likely to the
OL,15,Fnorth west. Temperatures are likely to
OL,16,Fbe slightly above average initially
OL,17,Fbefore becoming near-average towards
OL,18,Fthe latter parts of September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
